WEBVTT

01:12.900 --> 01:18.540
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.020 --> 01:24.180
[Episode 04]

01:27.896 --> 01:29.616
You don't go to school.

01:30.696 --> 01:33.056
Do you really plan to raise horses
in your hometown?

01:34.016 --> 01:35.215
I've made up my mind.

01:35.216 --> 01:36.576
When I come of age next year,

01:36.576 --> 01:37.736
I'll ask Aunt Baoping to

01:37.736 --> 01:38.855
introduce a girlfriend to me.

01:38.856 --> 01:39.456
And then,

01:39.456 --> 01:40.536
I'll be together with her for a few years.

01:40.536 --> 01:42.055
When I reach the marriageable age,

01:42.056 --> 01:43.375
I'll marry her.

01:43.376 --> 01:43.776
In this case,

01:43.776 --> 01:45.856
granny can have her great-grandson early.

01:46.856 --> 01:48.295
Then what comes after birth?

01:48.296 --> 01:49.776
Do your child continue to help you raise horses?

01:49.776 --> 01:50.496
After birth,

01:50.496 --> 01:51.855
he or she will be sent to Kunming
to be raised by my father.

01:51.856 --> 01:53.256
So he has something to do when he's free.

01:53.256 --> 01:54.496
Kill two birds with one stone.

02:03.296 --> 02:03.816
Wanna kick me, right?

02:03.816 --> 02:04.816
Come on.

02:04.816 --> 02:05.416
You want to kick me?

02:05.416 --> 02:06.375
Come here.

02:06.376 --> 02:07.135
Kick me.

02:07.136 --> 02:07.815
Here.

02:07.816 --> 02:08.296
Kick me hard.

02:08.296 --> 02:09.175
Come kick me.

02:09.176 --> 02:10.056
I'm not going to school.

02:10.056 --> 02:10.536
I want freedom.

02:10.536 --> 02:11.376
Come and kick me.

02:11.376 --> 02:12.176
Kick me.

02:12.176 --> 02:13.256
Kick me!

02:13.256 --> 02:14.296
Come on!

02:14.296 --> 02:14.536
Yuan.

02:14.536 --> 02:15.056
I'm not going to school.

02:15.056 --> 02:15.456
I want freedom.

02:15.456 --> 02:16.136
Yuan.

02:16.136 --> 02:17.696
You made brother angry again?

02:18.336 --> 02:19.176
Xiaxia, you're here.

02:19.176 --> 02:19.656
Granny.

02:19.656 --> 02:21.136
We're waiting for you to have dinner.

02:21.136 --> 02:22.336
Ham for you.

02:23.856 --> 02:26.296
Such a good ham.

02:26.736 --> 02:28.055
Come here tomorrow.

02:28.056 --> 02:29.455
I'll cook it for you.

02:29.456 --> 02:30.456
Thank you, Granny.

02:31.456 --> 02:32.656
What's wrong, Yuan?

02:33.776 --> 02:35.176
He wants to kick me back to Kunming.

02:35.576 --> 02:36.816
Brother, you kick him out again?

02:37.096 --> 02:38.056
He doesn't like studying.

02:38.056 --> 02:39.216
You force him, and he'll suffer.

02:39.216 --> 02:40.775
It's also a waste of money for our family.

02:40.776 --> 02:42.096
That's it.

02:42.096 --> 02:43.296
Shut up.

02:48.416 --> 02:49.736
Yuan's issue,

02:49.736 --> 02:50.896
let's put it aside.

02:51.936 --> 02:52.936
Xiaxia,

02:53.096 --> 02:54.856
I invite you to come over for dinner today

02:55.096 --> 02:58.216
just to ask about your friend in Shanghai.

02:58.976 --> 03:00.296
My mom came to you again?

03:00.776 --> 03:02.575
Don't blame your mother.

03:02.576 --> 03:03.896
She's worried about you.

03:05.896 --> 03:07.615
My elder sister went to college.

03:07.616 --> 03:08.376
So my mom thinks that

03:08.376 --> 03:09.496
she's right about everything.

03:10.096 --> 03:11.256
I only graduated from junior high school.

03:11.256 --> 03:12.776
When my elder sister says I'm wrong,

03:12.776 --> 03:14.216
my mother thinks I'm wrong.

03:14.856 --> 03:16.616
Then tell me the truth.

03:16.936 --> 03:19.176
What will you do to go to Shanghai?

03:22.856 --> 03:24.176
Just to travel around.

03:25.016 --> 03:25.536
In my life,

03:25.536 --> 03:26.896
the farthest place I've been to is Kunming.

03:26.896 --> 03:28.776
I forgot it because it was in my childhood.

03:32.536 --> 03:33.496
You just travel there.

03:33.496 --> 03:34.776
Don't you look for a job?

03:36.696 --> 03:38.536
I'll go and see it first.

03:39.856 --> 03:41.856
Then do you go there to find a job?

03:56.896 --> 03:58.936
You have learned wood carving for so long.

03:59.216 --> 04:00.776
When my uncle was drunk a few days ago,

04:00.776 --> 04:02.736
he said your skills got better and better.

04:03.776 --> 04:05.816
It's not easy to learn a skill.

04:06.176 --> 04:07.736
Is it so easy to give up?

04:09.576 --> 04:10.576
No.

04:11.016 --> 04:12.255
Kaiwen told me.

04:12.256 --> 04:13.935
And he's my friend in Shanghai.

04:13.936 --> 04:14.736
He has friends in Shanghai

04:14.736 --> 04:16.095
who opened a wood carving studio.

04:16.096 --> 04:17.536
He could introduce me to the interview.

04:17.776 --> 04:18.976
I'll see if it's okay.

04:19.976 --> 04:22.496
His friend opened a wood carving studio.

04:22.496 --> 04:23.776
Then what is he doing?

04:24.176 --> 04:25.416
He runs a homestay.

04:25.416 --> 04:26.896
Recently, he went to Tonglu on business.

04:27.456 --> 04:28.536
He said that when he finished his work,

04:28.536 --> 04:29.616
he'd let me go to Shanghai

04:29.616 --> 04:30.696
and stay in his house.

04:37.416 --> 04:38.016
This is him.

04:38.016 --> 04:39.016
The middle one.

04:42.696 --> 04:45.056
He looks like at your age.

04:45.456 --> 04:46.576
He's two years older than me.

04:46.576 --> 04:47.776
And he's much better than me.

04:54.336 --> 04:55.936
How did you know each other?

04:56.376 --> 04:57.736
I made live-streaming when working.

04:57.736 --> 04:58.855
I have few audiences.

04:58.856 --> 05:00.335
Only he gave me a reward.

05:00.336 --> 05:01.376
Later, my master caught me.

05:01.376 --> 05:02.695
He said I didn't focus on my job.

05:02.696 --> 05:03.776
Then I stopped it.

05:12.616 --> 05:14.936
Brother, don't always regard me as a child.

05:15.496 --> 05:16.776
I'm 22.

05:17.336 --> 05:18.616
I just want to go out and look around.

05:23.856 --> 05:25.856
Then how do you plan to tell your master?

05:26.776 --> 05:28.296
I say I'd just travel there for a couple of days.

05:28.976 --> 05:29.776
And the job,

05:29.776 --> 05:31.296
they don't necessarily want me.

05:32.416 --> 05:34.016
My master has been angry recently.

05:34.016 --> 05:35.496
Don't make excuses.

05:36.536 --> 05:39.136
If you do have the idea of going out
and looking for a job,

05:39.376 --> 05:41.016
you should tell uncle clearly.

05:41.336 --> 05:43.176
This is the least respect for him.

05:44.176 --> 05:46.256
And the woodcarving workshop

05:46.256 --> 05:48.136
can also arrange other workers.

05:49.576 --> 05:50.736
Okay, I see.

05:53.616 --> 05:55.456
As for your mother,

05:57.256 --> 05:58.376
I'll talk to her.

05:59.056 --> 06:00.056
Eat first.

06:01.096 --> 06:02.096
Thank you, brother.

06:02.376 --> 06:04.135
Yes, that's great, Xiaxia!

06:04.136 --> 06:05.576
Remember to bring me a gift.

06:05.576 --> 06:06.656
No problem.

06:07.176 --> 06:08.296
Eat.

06:09.536 --> 06:10.936
Granny, what are you doing?

06:10.936 --> 06:12.255
Come to dinner.

06:12.256 --> 06:14.335
I'm frying some milk cakes.

06:14.336 --> 06:15.136
No need to fry them, Granny.

06:15.136 --> 06:16.136
It's enough.

06:16.176 --> 06:17.576
Granny, come here for dinner.

06:17.576 --> 06:18.136
Granny.

06:18.136 --> 06:19.656
Right away.

06:19.656 --> 06:20.696
You two eat first.

06:20.696 --> 06:21.616
I'll help.

06:21.616 --> 06:22.616
Okay.

06:24.096 --> 06:25.256
Brother, this is very delicious.

06:25.256 --> 06:25.656
Try it.

06:25.656 --> 06:26.256
Granny.

06:26.256 --> 06:27.335
Let me help you.

06:27.336 --> 06:28.456
Did he kick you?

06:28.936 --> 06:30.296
He dare not kick me.

06:31.936 --> 06:33.216
Yao.

06:35.616 --> 06:36.696
Alright.

06:36.696 --> 06:38.056
Then I know.

06:40.016 --> 06:41.856
Is he back now?

06:43.976 --> 06:45.296
He's not arrived yet.

06:45.576 --> 06:48.095
Okay, then I got it.

06:48.096 --> 06:49.856
Rest early.

06:50.216 --> 06:51.416
Alright.

07:23.736 --> 07:25.576
Is that you, Xiaxia?

07:36.496 --> 07:37.496
Sit here.

07:50.336 --> 07:51.336
Well,

07:52.296 --> 07:54.336
Yao called me

07:54.736 --> 07:56.136
and told me to let you go.

07:57.376 --> 07:59.695
Since your brother has said that,

07:59.696 --> 08:01.136
I won't stop you.

08:02.336 --> 08:03.776
Are you still angry?

08:05.496 --> 08:07.056
I'm not angry.

08:07.056 --> 08:08.976
I'm just worried.

08:10.456 --> 08:12.176
In my whole life,

08:12.176 --> 08:13.256
not to mention Shanghai,

08:13.256 --> 08:14.976
I've not even been to the provincial capital.

08:14.976 --> 08:17.216
You go so far this time,

08:17.976 --> 08:20.376
traveling by planes and trains.

08:20.376 --> 08:22.256
I'm just worried.

08:25.456 --> 08:26.736
Yao also told me that

08:26.736 --> 08:28.896
you are an adult now.

08:29.256 --> 08:32.216
He asked me not to treat you like a child.

08:33.216 --> 08:34.376
Since you have that idea

08:34.376 --> 08:35.976
to go to the big city,

08:35.976 --> 08:37.216
I should let you go.

08:39.976 --> 08:41.056
I just think that

08:41.056 --> 08:43.016
I'm sorry for your master.

08:44.336 --> 08:46.176
He has been guiding you for five or six years.

08:46.416 --> 08:48.696
You're about to get to work.

08:48.696 --> 08:49.856
And you leave now.

08:51.216 --> 08:52.496
When we meet in the village,

08:52.496 --> 08:54.016
it's embarrassing.

08:58.976 --> 09:00.896
Don't worry about the family.

09:02.096 --> 09:02.936
And you don't have to think about

09:02.936 --> 09:04.416
sending money home.

09:04.976 --> 09:06.816
I work in the warehouse.

09:07.536 --> 09:09.216
That salary is enough.

09:10.016 --> 09:11.016
It's just you.

09:11.016 --> 09:12.576
The outside is not as good as home,

09:12.576 --> 09:14.616
where there is a hot meal waiting at the door.

09:14.896 --> 09:15.696
When you're outside,

09:15.696 --> 09:16.976
everything is on your own.

09:19.096 --> 09:20.536
I heard people say that

09:20.856 --> 09:22.856
there are not all good people outside.

09:23.176 --> 09:24.616
You're artless.

09:25.976 --> 09:27.616
I'm afraid others will bully you.

09:29.416 --> 09:30.976
I'm afraid you'll go down the wrong path.

09:32.656 --> 09:34.416
Auntie Feng's son,

09:34.416 --> 09:35.615
Xie Qiang,

09:35.616 --> 09:37.255
was such a good boy.

09:37.256 --> 09:38.935
Then he went out with the bad guys

09:38.936 --> 09:39.856
and didn't follow the right path.

09:39.856 --> 09:41.616
He ended up in jail.

09:47.976 --> 09:48.296
That's all.

09:48.296 --> 09:49.816
Pour the water for me.

09:58.136 --> 10:00.216
Don't just pour it out. Pour into the bucket.

10:00.216 --> 10:01.936
I'll flush the toilet with it.

10:05.496 --> 10:06.496
Mom,

10:08.776 --> 10:10.416
I'll make a lot of money in the future

10:10.736 --> 10:12.496
and buy you a big house in the city.

10:13.296 --> 10:15.016
Near the hospital. Everything is around.

10:15.616 --> 10:16.656
Just wait.

10:23.656 --> 10:24.936
I'm not used to living here.

10:24.936 --> 10:26.816
Take your wife to live there.

10:52.136 --> 10:54.295
Your family has so many talents.

10:54.296 --> 10:55.776
Yuan is not enough.

10:55.776 --> 10:56.976
There's also Xiaxia.

10:57.496 --> 10:59.535
Xiaxia is different from Yuan.

10:59.536 --> 11:01.656
Xiaxia is thoughtful since his childhood.

11:02.016 --> 11:03.855
His father left early.

11:03.856 --> 11:06.416
Aunt Baoping brought up two children
all by herself.

11:06.896 --> 11:08.976
Xiaochun is older.

11:08.976 --> 11:09.616
He knew to help the family

11:09.616 --> 11:10.895
wash clothes and cook.

11:10.896 --> 11:12.136
Xiaxia was only eight or nine years old.

11:12.136 --> 11:13.136
And he followed a bunch of uncles

11:13.136 --> 11:15.256
to the mountain to collect mushrooms
and sell them.

11:17.056 --> 11:18.296
Cerebral Haemorrhage before

11:18.296 --> 11:20.616
was an incurable emergency.

11:21.216 --> 11:23.656
Uncle Zeqing was sent to the city hospital
by tractors.

11:24.016 --> 11:25.496
It's delayed on the way.

11:26.056 --> 11:27.736
If this hospital was closed,

11:28.376 --> 11:29.936
maybe he could be saved.

11:40.296 --> 11:41.936
Your dad used to consider about

11:42.336 --> 11:43.416
sending Yuan to their hometown

11:43.416 --> 11:44.615
to raise horses.

11:44.616 --> 11:46.215
Let him suffer

11:46.216 --> 11:47.935
and know that life is not easy.

11:47.936 --> 11:48.576
And he must be willing to

11:48.576 --> 11:49.816
go back to school.

11:50.176 --> 11:51.456
It's all right now.

11:51.696 --> 11:53.336
He's addicted to raising horses.

11:54.176 --> 11:55.376
I'm having a headache.

11:55.856 --> 11:57.216
A little trouble makes him want to quit.

11:57.216 --> 11:58.376
What's the matter?

11:58.936 --> 12:00.336
Isn't he poor at learning?

12:01.776 --> 12:03.776
Right, he can't learn.

12:05.416 --> 12:06.216
Guobao,

12:06.216 --> 12:07.096
you've been playing for ten minutes.

12:07.096 --> 12:08.096
Stop playing.

12:09.176 --> 12:10.935
Let me play for a while more.

12:10.936 --> 12:12.975
Let me play for a while more.

12:12.976 --> 12:14.136
You are too young

12:14.136 --> 12:15.096
to play games.

12:15.096 --> 12:15.856
Play games.

12:15.856 --> 12:17.216
It's harmful to your eyes.

12:17.216 --> 12:18.936
Can you write your name now?

12:18.936 --> 12:19.576
Idiot.

12:19.576 --> 12:20.616
Daddy.

12:20.616 --> 12:21.296
Idiot.

12:21.296 --> 12:22.456
Daddy.

12:22.456 --> 12:23.495
Hit her.

12:23.496 --> 12:24.736
Playing all day long.

12:24.736 --> 12:25.936
And you.

12:25.936 --> 12:27.056
Guobao is still under five.

12:27.056 --> 12:27.936
And she puts on glasses.

12:27.936 --> 12:29.016
Don't you manage her?

12:29.576 --> 12:31.536
She's not noisy
only when she plays with the phone.

12:32.776 --> 12:33.616
Are you?

12:33.616 --> 12:35.296
Let me see your little glasses.

12:36.016 --> 12:37.576
You're lovely with glasses,

12:37.576 --> 12:38.576
right?

12:41.896 --> 12:43.056
Cute, right?

12:43.416 --> 12:45.056
You should get married and have a baby.

12:45.056 --> 12:46.616
It's interesting to have a kid.

12:46.616 --> 12:47.616
Is it?

12:47.976 --> 12:50.015
Guobao, call me daddy.

12:50.016 --> 12:51.136
Daddy.

12:51.656 --> 12:52.856
Kiss your daddy.

12:54.656 --> 12:55.576
If your sister-in-law hears,

12:55.576 --> 12:56.776
she'll come out and kick you to death.

12:57.136 --> 12:58.536
Guobao, don't play with the phone.

12:58.536 --> 13:00.496
How about playing games with daddy?

13:56.496 --> 13:57.856
Why did you get up?

13:58.176 --> 13:59.176
Can't sleep?

13:59.776 --> 14:01.456
I slept a lot in the afternoon.

14:05.296 --> 14:06.696
You didn't sleep, too.

14:10.376 --> 14:11.496
Do you want to eat?

14:11.496 --> 14:13.336
I'm not hungry, thanks.

14:13.736 --> 14:14.975
You'll be hungry soon.

14:14.976 --> 14:16.215
I have experience.

14:16.216 --> 14:17.455
I'll get the dishes.

14:17.456 --> 14:18.696
Let's eat together.

14:34.536 --> 14:35.376
Enough chili?

14:35.376 --> 14:36.496
Add more.

14:40.656 --> 14:42.056
Do you want chili, Hongdou?

14:42.376 --> 14:43.456
A little.

14:45.016 --> 14:46.016
Thank you.

14:56.736 --> 14:57.935
Damai,

14:57.936 --> 14:59.415
your noodle is so delicious.

14:59.416 --> 15:01.056
You can open a restaurant.

15:02.536 --> 15:04.575
It requires no skills.

15:04.576 --> 15:05.576
Whatever ingredients I have,

15:05.576 --> 15:06.696
I just throw them into the pot

15:06.696 --> 15:07.816
and boil them together.

15:08.376 --> 15:09.216
With the same ingredients,

15:09.216 --> 15:10.495
some people can cook well,

15:10.496 --> 15:11.896
others can't.

15:12.456 --> 15:14.336
I'm the one who can't cook it well.

15:14.616 --> 15:15.736
Damai's cooking is delicious.

15:15.736 --> 15:16.976
But she doesn't wash the dishes.

15:16.976 --> 15:17.656
I'm not cooking well.

15:17.656 --> 15:18.896
But I can do the dishes.

15:18.896 --> 15:20.896
So every time I want night snacks,

15:20.896 --> 15:22.216
I just call her.

15:22.616 --> 15:23.656
Meal buddies.

15:25.176 --> 15:27.535
Hongdou, how about your cooking?

15:27.536 --> 15:28.616
Not good.

15:28.616 --> 15:29.336
I'm busy with my work.

15:29.336 --> 15:30.696
And I don't cook much.

15:31.216 --> 15:32.736
The kitchen in the apartment

15:32.736 --> 15:34.616
is small and smelly.

15:36.336 --> 15:37.856
What do you do for a living?

15:38.176 --> 15:41.016
I was working at the hotel's Front Office.

15:41.336 --> 15:42.776
Front Office?

15:43.136 --> 15:46.136
It's... Lobby Manager.

15:46.536 --> 15:49.016
I was in charge of catering, guest rooms,

15:49.016 --> 15:50.935
and the executive lounge.

15:50.936 --> 15:53.016
Coordinate among departments

15:53.016 --> 15:54.576
and provide better service for guests.

15:55.656 --> 15:56.856
Awesome.

15:56.856 --> 15:58.456
What's awesome about that?

15:58.696 --> 16:00.896
I got promoted by virtue of seniority.

16:00.896 --> 16:02.776
After all, my age was there.

16:03.016 --> 16:04.935
Very awesome.

16:04.936 --> 16:05.976
After I graduated from college,

16:05.976 --> 16:07.416
I've never worked in the office.

16:09.336 --> 16:10.656
Freelance?

16:10.656 --> 16:11.816
What do you do?

16:14.176 --> 16:15.336
Damai is an online writer.

16:15.336 --> 16:17.056
She works at home normally.

16:17.576 --> 16:18.656
Writer.

16:20.136 --> 16:22.296
It's my first time meeting a writer.

16:22.936 --> 16:26.935
Just a small online writer sitting at home.

16:26.936 --> 16:28.616
I have neither representative works

16:28.976 --> 16:30.216
nor sense of existence.

16:30.216 --> 16:33.576
A transparent one whose existence
is meaningless to the world.

16:34.016 --> 16:35.176
How can you say that?

16:35.176 --> 16:37.015
Online writers are amazing.

16:37.016 --> 16:38.136
Unlike me,

16:38.136 --> 16:39.536
when I write an 800-word composition,

16:39.536 --> 16:41.536
I need punctuation to reach the word count.

16:44.736 --> 16:46.416
Where can I read your novel?

16:46.416 --> 16:47.816
I want to appreciate it.

16:48.136 --> 16:49.256
I... I think...

16:50.056 --> 16:52.096
I think there's no need to read it.

16:52.096 --> 16:52.896
I don't write well.

16:52.896 --> 16:53.736
And I don't want to lose my vest.

16:53.736 --> 16:54.456
Wait till I write a good one.

16:54.456 --> 16:55.775
I'll send it to you then.

16:55.776 --> 16:56.735
Lose the vest?

16:56.736 --> 16:57.736
Lose her online alias.

16:59.376 --> 17:01.136
I won't ask.

17:01.936 --> 17:03.216
What about Nana?

17:05.216 --> 17:07.736
I was a cashier in a coffee shop in Shanghai.

17:07.736 --> 17:08.776
Later, they laid off employees.

17:08.776 --> 17:10.536
So I drove to Yunnan.

17:10.776 --> 17:12.296
I came here by chance.

17:12.296 --> 17:13.336
I really liked it.

17:13.336 --> 17:14.856
So I stayed here to work.

17:38.096 --> 17:39.616
[Card]

17:43.896 --> 17:45.936
Please take out your cash.

17:46.776 --> 17:48.816
Please take out your card.

17:51.576 --> 17:53.576
You only need to change the screen.

17:53.896 --> 17:55.616
The content in the phone won't disappear, right?

17:55.616 --> 17:56.856
No, the motherboard is not broken,

17:56.856 --> 17:57.856
Don't worry.

17:58.176 --> 17:59.896
There is no screen in my store.

17:59.896 --> 18:00.696
It needs to be sent here.

18:00.696 --> 18:01.736
Please leave a number for me.

18:01.736 --> 18:03.216
I'll call you after it is repaired.

18:03.456 --> 18:05.096
I don't have a cell phone.

18:05.096 --> 18:06.416
Or you can leave me a number.

18:06.416 --> 18:07.576
I'll call you.

18:08.016 --> 18:09.855
Here's a business card.

18:09.856 --> 18:11.176
It takes about three days.

18:11.536 --> 18:12.536
Okay.

18:39.976 --> 18:42.536
Do you have an alarm clock or something?

18:42.536 --> 18:43.935
No.

18:43.936 --> 18:45.096
What about a watch?

18:45.096 --> 18:46.096
No, either.

18:46.096 --> 18:47.896
No one buys that, so I don't order.

18:47.896 --> 18:50.256
You can set the alarm clock
with your cell phone.

18:50.256 --> 18:51.376
It's convenient.

18:51.376 --> 18:53.536
The phone is broken and in repair.

18:53.536 --> 18:54.856
How much is it?

18:58.296 --> 18:59.296
86 yuan.

19:00.976 --> 19:02.256
How long will you stay here?

19:02.256 --> 19:03.456
Three months.

19:04.096 --> 19:05.136
Do you come to learn embroidery?

19:05.136 --> 19:05.696
No.

19:05.696 --> 19:06.816
Just traveling.

19:10.296 --> 19:11.416
Here's your change, 14 yuan.

19:13.456 --> 19:15.296
You knew Yao before?

19:15.856 --> 19:17.095
No.

19:17.096 --> 19:19.136
Then he let you ride Lil Cute.

19:20.616 --> 19:21.896
I stepped on horse dung.

19:23.576 --> 19:25.176
I'll step on horse dung next time.

19:26.576 --> 19:27.576
Forget it.

19:28.336 --> 19:30.216
My name is Xiaoqin. What's your name?

19:31.096 --> 19:32.136
Xu Hongdou.

19:32.376 --> 19:33.576
So fancy.

19:33.576 --> 19:34.896
I also have a fancy name.

19:34.896 --> 19:36.256
I picked it up myself.

19:39.296 --> 19:40.976
Don't you ask me what my name is?

19:41.336 --> 19:42.656
What's your name?

19:42.656 --> 19:44.856
My name is Candy.

19:46.056 --> 19:47.136
Candy.

19:47.936 --> 19:49.456
How about it? Fancy, right?

19:49.456 --> 19:50.456
Fancy.

19:51.096 --> 19:53.175
You're busy. I'll go first.

19:53.176 --> 19:54.335
Come and play when you are free.

19:54.336 --> 19:55.336
Okay.

20:15.856 --> 20:16.896
Xiaxia.

20:17.336 --> 20:18.216
Didn't you go to Guangzhou?

20:18.216 --> 20:18.896
Not yet.

20:18.896 --> 20:19.856
My dad asked me to come

20:19.856 --> 20:20.855
to say goodbye to the master.

20:20.856 --> 20:21.616
Stop!

20:21.616 --> 20:22.496
I'll go first.

20:22.496 --> 20:23.496
Stop!

20:23.736 --> 20:24.816
Come back!

20:25.736 --> 20:27.056
Come back!

20:27.056 --> 20:28.776
Take it back!

20:36.296 --> 20:37.656
You don't stay in the woodcarving workshop.

20:37.656 --> 20:39.016
What are you doing here?

20:41.336 --> 20:42.216
Yeah, right.

20:42.216 --> 20:43.896
Take all these

20:43.896 --> 20:44.776
and return them.

20:44.776 --> 20:45.496
Tell their families.

20:45.496 --> 20:47.615
Don't come again during festivals.

20:47.616 --> 20:48.616
Go ahead.

20:49.456 --> 20:50.656
Shall I go?

20:51.616 --> 20:53.535
Of course you!

20:53.536 --> 20:54.936
Hurry up and tidy up.

21:05.016 --> 21:06.936
Why do you come to me?

21:08.456 --> 21:09.696
Nothing, master.

21:10.616 --> 21:12.016
Let's talk about it tomorrow.

21:12.416 --> 21:14.376
Tell me, don't hesitate.

21:17.056 --> 21:18.056
Say it!

21:20.056 --> 21:21.615
Master, I just...

21:21.616 --> 21:22.736
I want to travel to Shanghai for some days.

21:22.736 --> 21:25.616
And see if I can find a job over there.

21:31.416 --> 21:32.896
I heard from friends in Shanghai that

21:32.896 --> 21:35.136
The wood carving studio over there is recruiting.

21:36.056 --> 21:37.656
I've never been anywhere else.

21:37.656 --> 21:39.176
I just want to have a look.

21:40.256 --> 21:41.576
They may not accept me.

21:43.856 --> 21:46.416
Master, don't be angry.

21:51.576 --> 21:52.576
Go ahead.

21:54.656 --> 21:56.016
My little temple can't hold

21:56.016 --> 21:57.336
you great Bodhisattva.

22:02.616 --> 22:03.616
Go ahead.

22:48.096 --> 22:50.255
[Express Waybills, Dali to Zibo]

22:50.256 --> 22:55.736
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

22:57.696 --> 23:02.376
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

23:02.376 --> 23:04.656
[Express Waybills, Dali to Nanjing]

23:05.096 --> 23:11.176
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

23:11.496 --> 23:16.856
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

23:19.816 --> 23:25.216
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

23:28.576 --> 23:30.216
It must be able to get out.

23:30.216 --> 23:32.136
I don't think it can get out.

23:32.616 --> 23:33.816
Come on, ants.

23:33.816 --> 23:34.936
Be brave.

23:34.936 --> 23:37.056
I said they couldn't come out.

23:44.216 --> 23:45.776
Why can't they come out?

23:45.776 --> 23:47.976
Just run out with nose pinched.

23:49.456 --> 23:50.655
Tuotuo.

23:50.656 --> 23:52.096
It's you.

23:52.896 --> 23:54.256
We meet again.

23:54.256 --> 23:55.336
Is this your friend?

23:55.336 --> 23:56.776
Yeah, he's called Huzi.

23:56.776 --> 23:58.295
Hello, Huzi.

23:58.296 --> 23:59.495
Who is she?

23:59.496 --> 24:01.736
She's a new friend I just met.

24:01.736 --> 24:04.175
I don't know who she is.

24:04.176 --> 24:05.136
My name is Xu Hongdou.

24:05.136 --> 24:07.215
You can also call me Aunt Hongdou.

24:07.216 --> 24:08.336
You're not an aunt.

24:08.336 --> 24:09.976
You are a sister.

24:10.416 --> 24:11.936
Your mother and I are of the same generation.

24:11.936 --> 24:13.296
You should call me aunt.

24:13.296 --> 24:15.376
My mom said someone old like this

24:15.376 --> 24:16.896
can be called aunt.

24:16.896 --> 24:19.136
Look, it's still circling.

24:28.936 --> 24:30.736
Come on, ants.

24:38.216 --> 24:43.056
[Receipt for a Loan of Tuotuo's telephone watch]

24:43.456 --> 24:44.496
Sister Hongdou,

24:44.496 --> 24:46.296
I'll go to play with you some other day.

24:46.296 --> 24:47.615
Okay, Bye.

24:47.616 --> 24:48.295
Bye.

24:48.296 --> 24:49.696
Bye.

24:51.776 --> 24:53.576
Thank you, Sister Hongdou.

25:04.576 --> 25:10.816
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

25:11.056 --> 25:17.976
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

25:19.256 --> 25:21.215
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

25:21.216 --> 25:25.815
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

25:25.816 --> 25:32.816
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

25:33.176 --> 25:40.136
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

25:57.736 --> 25:58.896
Miss Xu.

26:01.576 --> 26:02.576
Mr. Ma.

26:03.216 --> 26:04.415
Have some tea?

26:04.416 --> 26:05.415
Sure.

26:05.416 --> 26:06.416
Let's go.

26:26.136 --> 26:28.696
Pu'er tea or black tea?

26:28.696 --> 26:29.816
I'm fine with both.

26:30.856 --> 26:34.096
That's the hardest type to serve.

26:35.016 --> 26:36.056
Pu'er Tea.

27:14.656 --> 27:15.936
Are you bored?

27:15.936 --> 27:16.936
No.

27:18.416 --> 27:21.416
You've just read dozens of pages.

27:23.816 --> 27:25.576
The phone is of more fun, right?

27:26.576 --> 27:27.696
Yes.

27:28.216 --> 27:28.816
But,

27:28.816 --> 27:30.856
I can't play it all the time.

27:31.416 --> 27:32.856
It's bad for the eyes.

27:32.856 --> 27:35.736
And I will feel empty.

27:38.256 --> 27:41.936
When the human's brain is stimulated,

27:42.656 --> 27:44.776
it will produce a strong reaction.

27:45.056 --> 27:47.775
The excitement threshold will be
higher and higher.

27:47.776 --> 27:50.576
Emotional control will get worse.

27:51.296 --> 27:52.536
So,

27:53.216 --> 27:54.976
when you put down your phone,

27:55.376 --> 27:58.055
you'll feel empty,

27:58.056 --> 27:59.336
and boring.

28:01.016 --> 28:03.056
Then your emotions

28:03.056 --> 28:05.576
will be excited and irritable.

28:07.536 --> 28:08.896
Over the course of time,

28:09.416 --> 28:13.016
you'll be screwed up.

28:14.376 --> 28:15.816
Can I still be saved?

28:17.376 --> 28:18.416
Meditate.

28:19.056 --> 28:21.056
What do you think when meditating?

28:23.496 --> 28:25.456
At the beginning of meditation,

28:27.296 --> 28:29.856
you have to learn to control yourself.

28:32.296 --> 28:37.816
Throw away all the distractions in your heart.

28:38.696 --> 28:47.616
Focus all your attention on your breath.

28:56.576 --> 28:58.816
What to do after focusing on breathing?

28:59.456 --> 29:02.536
Just concentrate here.

29:09.736 --> 29:11.056
That's it?

29:11.976 --> 29:13.936
That's it.

29:26.536 --> 29:27.816
It's better if you don't understand.

29:30.416 --> 29:33.455
Look at the tea.

29:33.456 --> 29:34.336
You want to say that

29:34.336 --> 29:38.216
even tea goes through trials and tribulations.

29:38.736 --> 29:41.336
It needs to be fermented for a long time

29:41.336 --> 29:43.136
to become tea.

29:43.376 --> 29:43.976
In this world,

29:43.976 --> 29:47.576
everything needs to practice.

29:48.176 --> 29:49.176
Right?

29:54.336 --> 29:55.896
I mean...

29:56.216 --> 29:59.136
The tea infusion is ruddy and shiny.

30:01.016 --> 30:01.976
It's ready to drink.

30:01.976 --> 30:02.976
Thank you.

30:18.176 --> 30:19.736
Won't you answer it?

30:20.976 --> 30:22.176
No need.

30:23.456 --> 30:25.256
It's tea time.

30:25.656 --> 30:28.736
Nothing else is important.

30:34.696 --> 30:35.696
However,

30:36.056 --> 30:37.616
it's a little annoying.

30:43.696 --> 30:44.816
My apology.

30:58.816 --> 31:00.176
The teacup is a little small.

31:00.176 --> 31:01.176
Give me more.

31:03.536 --> 31:06.976
Tea needs to be tasted.

31:10.896 --> 31:11.896
Okay.

31:23.056 --> 31:25.335
When will Mr. Li go to Shuhe River?

31:25.336 --> 31:26.456
I will go too.

31:26.456 --> 31:27.216
Then,

31:27.216 --> 31:28.656
make an appointment for me.

31:29.136 --> 31:31.295
This woodcarving workshop is not your business.

31:31.296 --> 31:32.336
Why do you care so much?

31:32.336 --> 31:33.695
You even go there yourself.

31:33.696 --> 31:35.136
It's within my ability.

31:35.136 --> 31:36.696
I'll help if I can.

31:36.936 --> 31:38.695
After all, I call him uncle.

31:38.696 --> 31:39.255
Right?

31:39.256 --> 31:40.016
I can just stand by and watch

31:40.016 --> 31:42.375
the woodcarving workshop get closed down.

31:42.376 --> 31:43.415
Alright.

31:43.416 --> 31:44.896
When Mr. Li decides the time to come,

31:44.896 --> 31:45.976
I'll tell you.

31:46.696 --> 31:47.456
Thanks, buddy.

31:47.456 --> 31:48.416
You're welcome.

31:48.416 --> 31:50.015
Let's chat when we meet someday.

31:50.016 --> 31:50.536
Bye.

31:50.536 --> 31:51.696
Okay.

31:54.656 --> 31:56.216
My Mr. Xie.

31:56.536 --> 31:57.736
You took care of all these things.

31:57.736 --> 31:59.255
Aren't you tired?

31:59.256 --> 32:00.615
You got a deal for him.

32:00.616 --> 32:01.536
That eases the symptoms,
but not cures the disease.

32:01.536 --> 32:02.895
He doesn't listen to you.

32:02.896 --> 32:04.895
You said to help him for free.

32:04.896 --> 32:06.775
He guarded against you just like a thief.

32:06.776 --> 32:08.855
He's not guarding against me.

32:08.856 --> 32:10.455
He just thinks that publicity

32:10.456 --> 32:12.616
is like every potter praises his own pot.

32:12.616 --> 32:14.536
It is shameless to brag.

32:15.416 --> 32:17.895
You show excessive passion to someone cold.

32:17.896 --> 32:18.856
It's okay.

32:18.856 --> 32:20.936
He will feel the warmth
if I show him more times.

32:21.696 --> 32:23.256
I like this in you very much.

32:23.816 --> 32:25.055
Trying to warm someone cold?

32:25.056 --> 32:26.976
Thick-skinned, just like me.

32:29.616 --> 32:31.015
Thick-skinned.

32:31.016 --> 32:33.575
Our new Tie-Dye Painting details page,

32:33.576 --> 32:34.896
have you designed it?

32:36.176 --> 32:37.336
Almost.

32:37.336 --> 32:38.416
I've just finished

32:38.416 --> 32:40.136
the design of the green plum packing box.

32:40.376 --> 32:42.136
Isn't it the day before yesterday?

32:43.416 --> 32:44.936
I'd better go back and do cross-talk.

32:44.936 --> 32:45.416
Look,

32:45.416 --> 32:46.136
even Landlord Zhou Bapi

32:46.136 --> 32:47.016
made the cock crow until midnight.

32:47.016 --> 32:48.815
You just don't let the cock sleep.

32:48.816 --> 32:50.495
Doesn't designing take time?

32:50.496 --> 32:51.896
The design of the green plum packing box

32:51.896 --> 32:54.255
just made some change
of the ugly apple's design.

32:54.256 --> 32:55.696
You should hurry up.

32:55.696 --> 32:56.856
On my side, the pre-sale promotion plans of

32:56.856 --> 32:58.496
Tie-Dye Paintings and green plums

32:58.496 --> 32:59.656
have been finished.

32:59.656 --> 33:00.536
Just wait for your picture

33:00.536 --> 33:01.895
to post them on our official account.

33:01.896 --> 33:03.136
Alright, Madam.

33:03.136 --> 33:05.175
I'm wrong. My bad.

33:05.176 --> 33:06.776
You are too lazy to do crosstalk.

33:06.776 --> 33:07.576
Begging on the overpass,

33:07.576 --> 33:08.975
and I'm afraid you'll be starving.

33:08.976 --> 33:09.656
We northerners

33:09.656 --> 33:10.736
won't bully those northerners.

33:11.176 --> 33:12.536
Don't make small groups with me.

33:22.776 --> 33:23.776
Hello?

33:28.856 --> 33:30.616
Hello.

33:32.896 --> 33:33.976
Right.

33:34.616 --> 33:35.616
Okay.

33:38.896 --> 33:40.136
Xu Hongdou.

33:42.856 --> 33:43.776
Your mother can't find you.

33:43.776 --> 33:45.096
She calls me here.

33:45.376 --> 33:46.496
My mother can't find me?

33:46.496 --> 33:47.736
Call her back soon.

33:47.736 --> 33:48.656
She sounds very anxious.

33:48.656 --> 33:49.175
Here.

33:49.176 --> 33:49.896
Thank you.

33:49.896 --> 33:51.296
Mr. Xie.

33:51.816 --> 33:53.056
Have some tea?

33:53.736 --> 33:54.736
Sure.

34:01.776 --> 34:03.176
Hello, Mom.

34:03.616 --> 34:04.416
What's up?

34:04.416 --> 34:06.136
Gang and his family

34:06.136 --> 34:08.215
want to travel to Beijing.

34:08.216 --> 34:11.616
You can apply for the preferential price
for employees.

34:12.616 --> 34:14.415
A 20% discount, right?

34:14.416 --> 34:15.816
How much is it with a 20% discount?

34:16.896 --> 34:18.496
More than nine hundred.

34:20.496 --> 34:22.535
Sister, let me talk to Hongdou.

34:22.536 --> 34:23.776
Let Aunt Sun talk with you.

34:27.656 --> 34:29.976
I'm Aunt Sun, Hongdou.

34:29.976 --> 34:31.136
Aunt Sun.

34:31.616 --> 34:33.456
Actually, Gang and his wife

34:33.456 --> 34:35.655
don't have to live in our hotel.

34:35.656 --> 34:37.735
Beijing's transportation is very convenient.

34:37.736 --> 34:39.136
The subway is also efficient.

34:39.816 --> 34:41.936
Well, Dou,

34:42.176 --> 34:43.576
it's because you are in Beijing.

34:43.576 --> 34:44.296
Right?

34:44.296 --> 34:47.776
Then we live in the hotel because of you.

34:47.776 --> 34:50.176
I mean, you are Manager,

34:50.176 --> 34:51.336
big leader or something.

34:51.336 --> 34:53.615
Can you make it cheaper?

34:53.616 --> 34:55.256
Unfortunately,

34:55.256 --> 34:57.736
I'm on vacation in Yunnan.

34:57.736 --> 34:59.256
I can't receive them.

34:59.256 --> 35:00.616
Besides, the hotel price

35:00.616 --> 35:02.096
is not my decision.

35:02.696 --> 35:04.416
I can't change it.

35:04.896 --> 35:06.616
Well, then, otherwise,

35:06.616 --> 35:09.656
tell me the price range you can accept,

35:09.656 --> 35:12.496
let me ask other friends in the hotel industry.

35:12.496 --> 35:15.056
Ask them to recommend
a cost-effective one for you.

35:16.456 --> 35:17.416
Five hundred?

35:17.416 --> 35:18.616
Five hundred, right?

35:18.616 --> 35:19.776
Got it.

35:19.776 --> 35:20.936
Let me help you choose.

35:21.816 --> 35:22.816
Okay.

35:22.816 --> 35:24.056
Thank you, Hongdou.

35:24.056 --> 35:25.176
Thank you, Dou.

35:25.456 --> 35:27.216
Come back often then.

35:27.216 --> 35:28.976
Aunt Sun will make delicious food for you,
all right?

35:29.376 --> 35:30.416
You can talk to your mother.

35:30.416 --> 35:31.336
Okay.

35:31.336 --> 35:32.216
Dou.

35:32.216 --> 35:34.375
how's your trip these days?

35:34.376 --> 35:35.496
Very good.

35:35.496 --> 35:37.695
We're in the yard with friends.

35:37.696 --> 35:39.696
Drink tea or something.

35:40.296 --> 35:41.936
Have you repaired your phone?

35:42.336 --> 35:43.296
I can't contact you.

35:43.296 --> 35:44.816
I'm worried.

35:44.816 --> 35:45.696
What are you worrying about?

35:45.696 --> 35:47.815
You don't call me every day.

35:47.816 --> 35:49.575
It's one thing whether I call or not.

35:49.576 --> 35:51.576
It's another thing that
I can't get in touch with you.

35:52.496 --> 35:53.296
I got it repaired.

35:53.296 --> 35:54.656
I'll get it in two days.

35:54.656 --> 35:55.815
That's good.

35:55.816 --> 35:57.055
Then you play.

35:57.056 --> 35:58.296
I'll hang up.

36:01.856 --> 36:02.936
Look at you.

36:02.936 --> 36:04.336
Your two daughters,

36:04.336 --> 36:06.056
how did you cultivate them?

36:06.056 --> 36:08.736
Both are successful.

36:08.736 --> 36:10.256
Before, my Gang

36:10.256 --> 36:11.856
was in the same class with your Hongmi.

36:11.856 --> 36:12.456
You remember it, right?

36:12.456 --> 36:13.416
Yes.

36:13.416 --> 36:14.536
One was the tail,

36:14.536 --> 36:15.816
and the other was the head.

36:15.816 --> 36:16.816
It's...

36:17.776 --> 36:19.896
Gang is also great now.

36:19.896 --> 36:21.856
He took his father's position
in the fertilizer factory,

36:21.856 --> 36:22.936
and just lives in the next building.

36:22.936 --> 36:24.056
If he wants to have dumplings,

36:24.056 --> 36:26.056
just say it aloud at the window.

36:26.856 --> 36:28.176
Unlike my children,

36:28.176 --> 36:29.816
year after year,

36:30.296 --> 36:31.856
I can't even see them.

36:33.336 --> 36:34.816
It depends.

36:34.816 --> 36:36.056
Look at the phone now.

36:36.056 --> 36:36.936
How convenient!

36:36.936 --> 36:38.375
It can also make video calls.

36:38.376 --> 36:39.736
No matter how far away,

36:39.736 --> 36:40.816
it's the same.

36:41.056 --> 36:42.696
It's the same.

36:43.616 --> 36:44.656
Alright.

36:46.856 --> 36:48.376
You didn't talk to your family

36:48.376 --> 36:49.936
about your resignation?

36:50.696 --> 36:52.696
I'm afraid they would worry if I tell them.

36:55.296 --> 36:58.255
Is there anything wrong with your work?

36:58.256 --> 36:59.256
No.

37:00.136 --> 37:03.375
Then you just don't want to work anymore?

37:03.376 --> 37:04.616
Not really.

37:04.616 --> 37:06.175
All these years.

37:06.176 --> 37:07.616
Day after day.

37:08.496 --> 37:09.496
I'm a little tired.

37:11.056 --> 37:12.856
Did you usually have no rest?

37:15.296 --> 37:17.375
Our industry is a little special.

37:17.376 --> 37:19.015
Even when you rest,

37:19.016 --> 37:20.936
you also need to reply to messages

37:21.296 --> 37:22.816
and make calls to customers.

37:23.176 --> 37:25.376
You can't relax.

37:25.376 --> 37:26.136
So usually,

37:26.136 --> 37:26.936
when I was off duty,

37:26.936 --> 37:28.816
I just wanted to lie down.

37:30.056 --> 37:31.015
Got it.

37:31.016 --> 37:32.936
The workers have no life.

37:33.736 --> 37:37.816
Life is all elsewhere.

37:38.216 --> 37:39.976
In front of us,

37:40.456 --> 37:42.615
everything is mundane.

37:42.616 --> 37:44.696
Here is elsewhere.

37:44.976 --> 37:46.895
You've come to the right place.

37:46.896 --> 37:49.856
The air is good in our Yunnan,
South of Colorful Clouds.

37:49.856 --> 37:51.136
No pollution.

37:51.136 --> 37:52.896
You can go out more.

37:52.896 --> 37:54.856
Have a sunbath and taste good food.

37:54.856 --> 37:56.496
Staying for three months, and you are sure to

37:56.496 --> 37:59.216
have all your spirit recovered.

38:01.696 --> 38:03.616
How long has Mr. Ma been here?

38:04.496 --> 38:05.936
Less than one year.

38:07.416 --> 38:10.735
He has absorbed the essence
of the sun and the moon.

38:10.736 --> 38:12.135
He's about to mutate.

38:12.136 --> 38:13.416
There is atavism.

38:13.416 --> 38:14.975
He doesn't talk normally.

38:14.976 --> 38:16.616
No wonder he's annoying.

38:17.976 --> 38:20.175
About the annoying thing,

38:20.176 --> 38:21.576
the ancients said,

38:21.576 --> 38:23.656
there are no rules for external things.
[Li Hao]

38:24.016 --> 38:24.456
Sorry.

38:24.456 --> 38:25.976
I need to answer the phone.

38:28.376 --> 38:30.696
Hello, old schoolmate.

38:32.896 --> 38:33.456
Right.

38:33.456 --> 38:35.616
The matter of transferring a student.

38:35.976 --> 38:38.336
The student's academic status
and registered residence are in Kunming.

38:40.176 --> 38:41.496
Please ask it for me first.

38:42.176 --> 38:42.696
Okay.

38:42.696 --> 38:43.976
I'll wait for your message.

38:44.416 --> 38:45.016
Okay.

38:45.016 --> 38:46.176
I'll treat you someday.

38:46.776 --> 38:47.576
Okay.

38:47.576 --> 38:48.576
Bye.

38:51.176 --> 38:53.056
Isn't your brother not going to school?

38:53.896 --> 38:54.856
He can't just stay at home

38:54.856 --> 38:56.136
and muddle along.

38:56.656 --> 38:59.655
Now it's all computer assignment
based on registered residence.

38:59.656 --> 39:01.695
It's not easy to transfer, right?

39:01.696 --> 39:04.256
Why not go to the school
in his registered residence?

39:05.016 --> 39:06.096
He...

39:06.776 --> 39:07.936
doesn't want to go there.

39:08.976 --> 39:10.256
Poor study?

39:10.256 --> 39:11.576
Not really.

39:11.576 --> 39:13.896
He's just naughty and lazy.

39:14.816 --> 39:18.776
About the laziness in human nature,

39:19.576 --> 39:21.896
it's a long story to tell.

39:22.296 --> 39:23.816
I'll go feed the horses.

39:23.816 --> 39:24.816
Goodbye.

39:27.656 --> 39:28.656
Goodbye.

39:30.256 --> 39:30.616
I...

39:30.616 --> 39:32.536
I'll check about the hotel.

39:32.536 --> 39:33.896
I'm leaving, too.

39:34.296 --> 39:35.496
Your tea is very delicious.

39:35.496 --> 39:36.496
Thank you.

39:42.016 --> 39:44.176
There are no rules for external things.

39:45.216 --> 39:48.296
But the heart needs to achieve emptiness.

39:50.536 --> 39:51.856
Definitely.

40:21.376 --> 40:22.496
Uncle.

40:23.016 --> 40:24.936
Eating alone?

40:24.936 --> 40:27.336
Let me add a dish for you.

40:28.776 --> 40:30.136
And this bottle of red wine.

40:30.136 --> 40:31.176
My good friend sent it to me.

40:31.176 --> 40:32.336
Let me share it with you.

40:36.136 --> 40:37.296
Why are you here?

40:37.936 --> 40:39.576
Xiaxia is going to Shanghai.

40:39.576 --> 40:40.616
I was thinking.

40:40.616 --> 40:41.896
What if he irritated you?

40:41.896 --> 40:43.576
I have to come and see you.

40:45.376 --> 40:48.176
I knew you are not really so nice.

40:48.176 --> 40:49.896
You came to make fun of me, didn't you?

40:49.896 --> 40:51.455
No.

40:51.456 --> 40:53.416
I just came to drink with you.

41:02.656 --> 41:04.696
The foreign wine, I'm not used to drinking it.

41:06.976 --> 41:09.376
Wine glowing in the luminous jade cups.

41:09.376 --> 41:11.736
Drinking to Pipa songs, we are summoned to fight.

41:11.736 --> 41:13.656
Don't laugh if we lay drunken
on the battleground.

41:13.656 --> 41:16.015
How many warriors ever come back safe and sound?

41:16.016 --> 41:17.056
There was wine in Tang Dynasty.

41:17.056 --> 41:19.416
How come it becomes a foreign drink?

41:19.696 --> 41:20.696
Come on.

41:21.216 --> 41:21.895
Taste it.

41:21.896 --> 41:22.896
Taste.

41:31.856 --> 41:33.216
Not bad.

41:37.056 --> 41:38.696
Horse urine is better than it.

41:39.056 --> 41:40.256
Drink it yourself.

41:43.296 --> 41:45.136
I knew you might not get used to it.

41:48.696 --> 41:50.696
Try this.

42:05.736 --> 42:07.576
Cherry wine made by Aunt?

42:08.536 --> 42:09.536
Great.

42:13.376 --> 42:14.376
Wonderful.

42:21.456 --> 42:23.736
Yao, let me tell you.

42:25.456 --> 42:26.776
At that time,

42:27.336 --> 42:28.416
you were young.

42:29.216 --> 42:30.616
You must not remember it.

42:31.896 --> 42:33.736
I was young then.

42:35.136 --> 42:37.416
I have over a dozen woodcarving masters.

42:37.776 --> 42:40.216
Their craft was awesome.

42:41.816 --> 42:44.016
At that time, every family built houses.

42:44.496 --> 42:46.096
They all came to us.

42:47.576 --> 42:49.096
People from the village

42:50.016 --> 42:50.896
and outside the village

42:50.896 --> 42:52.456
all came here to find us.

42:52.816 --> 42:54.895
The orders never stopped.

42:54.896 --> 42:56.816
They had to wait in line at the gate.

42:57.536 --> 42:59.216
The end of the line was out of sight.

43:01.696 --> 43:04.416
The family who wanted the children
to learn woodcarving

43:04.856 --> 43:10.056
always gave me wine, meat, fruits,
snacks or something.

43:10.336 --> 43:12.136
That never stopped, either.

43:14.376 --> 43:15.016
When did we need to

43:15.016 --> 43:16.576
beg someone else?

43:17.696 --> 43:19.816
It's all people coming to us.

43:24.816 --> 43:26.136
My son said that

43:27.016 --> 43:29.496
it's different now.

43:30.496 --> 43:33.016
It's all machine carving.

43:33.536 --> 43:35.455
Cheap and fast.

43:35.456 --> 43:37.655
People are replaced by machines.

43:37.656 --> 43:38.736
Most people in the future

43:38.736 --> 43:40.896
will be replaced by machines.

43:49.776 --> 43:52.096
The government asks me to pass the tradition on.

43:53.216 --> 43:55.056
Nobody wants to learn it.

43:55.376 --> 43:57.095
Even if someone learns it,

43:57.096 --> 43:57.775
well,

43:57.776 --> 43:59.296
the work in the future

43:59.296 --> 44:01.176
is all done by the machines.

44:02.136 --> 44:03.536
It's not working.

44:06.416 --> 44:07.416
Not working.

44:09.176 --> 44:11.016
It's not all true.

44:11.656 --> 44:12.616
What this machine can do

44:12.616 --> 44:14.176
is always the most basic thing.

44:14.576 --> 44:16.096
It can't replace people.

44:16.336 --> 44:18.016
Because it can't create things.

44:19.856 --> 44:25.176
Can the machines make your reliefs?

44:26.896 --> 44:29.416
Good things won't be replaced.

44:30.176 --> 44:32.055
But if no one knows them,

44:32.056 --> 44:33.615
no one appreciates them,

44:33.616 --> 44:36.016
they will disappear slowly.

44:37.136 --> 44:38.896
So we need to promote them,

44:38.896 --> 44:40.255
and to publicize them.

44:40.256 --> 44:42.575
Let more people know about this thing.

44:42.576 --> 44:44.576
So they can like it.

44:45.616 --> 44:47.136
Have you ever been to our embroidery workshop?

44:47.696 --> 44:49.176
I won't go.

44:49.176 --> 44:51.056
Those online stuffs are messy.

44:51.056 --> 44:52.096
I can't stand it.

44:54.496 --> 44:57.975
Both you and Master Huailan accept apprentices.

44:57.976 --> 45:00.015
Then why does she get more apprentices

45:00.016 --> 45:02.736
while yours ran out one by one?

